            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Вчера на улице было странное происшествие. Vcherá na úlitse býlo stránnoye proisshéstviye. Yesterday there was a strange incident in the street."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter. Usually something unpleasant or unexpected."
            }
