            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Каждый вечер он слушает хронику новостей. Kázhdyy vécher on slúshayet khróniku novostéy. Every evening he listens to the news round-up."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine. Хроника — a record of events in order."
            }
          ]
        },
