          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "хроника (khrónika) came through German Chronik from Latin chronica \"a chronicle\", from Greek khronikós \"of time\", built on khrónos \"time\" (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
