              "text": "итог (itóg) — \"the result, the total\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "В итоге мы решили остаться дома. V itóge my reshíli ostátsya dóma. In the end we decided to stay at home."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "В итоге — in the end; подвести итоги — to sum up."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "итог (itóg) is usually traced to и-, a form of из \"out\", and the root of течь \"to flow\": what flows out at the end. EtymDB lists no parent."
            }
          ]
        },
